            "review_title": "Review at Bun Ngan 23",
            "review_text": "Flore N\nDieppe, France314 contributions\n0\nThe best Bun Cha in Old Quarter Hanoi!\nJun 2018 • Family\nThis is situated right in front of Hanoi Culture Hostel.\nIt is a small street food stall in the corner, always busy, always delicious. \nWe kept on coming back to it. \nThe Bun Cha is delicious, the bbq pork meat balls are so tasty and you are also given a huge bowl of side salad and herbs to add to it. \nThe nems were good also, and the fried noodles and chicken very good. \nOur daughter also loved the rice soup, simple and perfect for a simple meal if you need.\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2018",
